</title><meta id="MetaDescription" name="description" content="Parkland College is a public community college in Champaign, Illinois. It is part of the Illinois Community College System serving Community College District 505 which includes parts of Coles, Champaign, DeWitt, Douglas, Edgar, Ford, Iroquois, Livingston, Moultrie, McLean, Piatt, and Vermilion Counties." /><meta id="MetaRobots" name="robots" content="INDEX, FOLLOW" /><link href="/Portals/3-System/dnn-css-variables.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Resources/Shared/stylesheets/dnndefault/10.0.0/default.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/DesktopModules/MVC/SlickSlider/module.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/DesktopModules/EasyDNNnews/Templates/_default/BlogOne/BlogOne.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/3/portal.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/CSS/Content.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/CSS/Main.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/CSS/Skin.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/CSS/Typography.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/assets/css/styles.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/skins/parklanddefault/assets/css/ie.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/DesktopModules/EasyDNNnews/static/rateit/css/rateit.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/Portals/_default/Skins/ParklandDefault/assets/js/slick/slick.css?cdv=838" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/><script src="/DesktopModules/EasyDNNNews/static/eds_jquery/eds_jq.js?cdv=838" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="/Resources/libraries/jQuery/03_07